      "description": "Revision tools licensed by the DVSA for the UK HGV (LGV) theory test. Also has practise case studies for Driver CPC part 2.   \n\nWhether you have one day or one month to revise, it’s the best way to prepare. Master all of the topics and you’ll be guaranteed to pass. \n\n\n=========================\n7 REASONS TO GET IT\n=========================\n\n\n1. LATEST DVSA LICENSED QUESTIONS – Contains every question, answer, explanation and image from the 2027 DVSA revision bank.\n\n2. 20 CASE STUDIES – Based on the DVSA syllabus, these are similar to those that will appear in your CPC module 2 test. \n\n3. UP-TO-DATE HAZARD PERCEPTION – All the latest revision hazard perception clips (48), licensed from DVSA, the people who set the live theory test.\n\n4. MOCK TESTS – Simulate the real theory test. Questions are randomly selected so there are almost an unlimited number of tests available. \n\n5. PRACTISE QUESTIONS – Get immediate feedback when you are wrong. This is by far the most effective way to learn.\n\n6. STUDY GUIDES – Do you have time to read the whole of The Highway Code? If not, our study guides are the answer. These focus only on what is actually covered in the theory tests.\n\n7. EASY TO USE INTERFACE – The clean layout and ease of navigating, take the stress out of studying. \n\n\n============================\nThis app is optimised for iPhone and iPod Touch. It also works on iPad and some iMacs.\n============================\n\n\nCrown copyright material reproduced under licence from the Driver and Vehicle Standards Agency which does not accept any responsibility for the accuracy of the reproduction.",
